{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与角与线段","englishTitle":"If a straight line be set up at right angles to three straight lines which meet one another, at their common point of section, the three straight lines are in one plane.","book":11,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","contentId":"euclid-11-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b3cf298525a71a7447e3ec562b40722e5ff23293c45b98f9fd67db20af585cb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-5.statement","euclid-11-5.construction.1","euclid-11-5.proof.1","euclid-11-5.construction.2","euclid-11-5.proof.2","euclid-11-5.proof.3","euclid-11-5.proof.4","euclid-11-5.proof.5","euclid-11-5.proof.6","euclid-11-5.proof.7","euclid-11-5.proof.8","euclid-11-5.proof.9","euclid-11-5.conclusion","euclid-11-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86e7152d0d09a29eeb050a92da924af5c9290e1de0e01cfd6a04bf2dc5de19eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be set up at right angles to three straight lines which meet one another, at their common point of section, the three straight lines are in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线在直角至3条直线上设置,在它们共同的一节点,则三条直线为1 平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05e9dcd537c3ae2e1d68130e97ac7f06868f0a9f820fd4dc5a3c356d84d63903","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line AB be set up at right angles to the three straight lines BC, BD, BE, at their point of meeting at B; I say that BC, BD, BE are in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将直线 AB设置在直角至3条直线BC、BD、BE,在B相交点;我说,BC、BD、BE是1 平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b1023a1b69f1d93740492385d331d152411c91fdf5bab4d234b2baf011d3a2b","citations":["euclid-11-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose they are not, but, if possible, let BD, BE be in the plane of reference and BC in one more elevated; let the plane through AB, BC be produced; it will thus make, as common section in the plane of reference, a straight line. [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设它们不是,但如果可能,则让BD、BE列入参考文献,BC列入一个以上文献;让平面至AB、BC列入;这样,它作为参考文献的共同部分,将形成一条直线。 [[XI. 3](/principles/euclid-11-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed9177ab7981dd6e9015db22b5376407dcf2989a5a20e40fcc75bf626b4909bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it make BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BF块吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00e48534cf3bcc20001d34cd234e85a15e5aeeda63884a2fe0dbd25cb6528811","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the three straight lines AB, BC, BF are in one plane, namely that drawn through AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,3条直线AB、BC、BF是一条平面线,即AB、BC线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27d6be9d92b1f572bf2e5359babf8b6c1c3fca83c0d92e2096a703d9c8ad1fc7","citations":["euclid-11-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is at right angles to each of the straight lines BD, BE, therefore AB is also at right angles to the plane through BD, BE. [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AB是BD线的直角,BE线,AB线的直角至平面至BD线的BE线。 [[XI. 4](/principles/euclid-11-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1d1adbfe780fdd5830c0508281ec2bb78e57e49c35df77b77494ab557d114a0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the plane through BD, BE is the plane of reference; therefore AB is at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平面至BD,BE是平面参考;因此,AB是直角至平面参考。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fe03fb5fcf06dd4409608b21df08ea47b55531f0885551ed2fc26dec5884cd2","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus AB will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB还将达到直角, 加上所有相交的直线, 并处于参考线平面。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93f5487f4b2a678eb9fce4b7e1a295cc3854f313bce5c4846821d2eb3f5ac7a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BF which is in the plane of reference meets it; therefore the angle ABF is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但参考文献平面中的BF是相交的,因此角度ABF是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e213a5966998dbb739d1e751fbabd096804fa0a30b7059bb14ec22e53bfb191","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the angle ABC is also right; therefore the angle ABF is equal to the angle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设ABC角度也是对的;因此,ABF角度等于ABC角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ea6e1ff79e0d3c3b49c871849291705333a3f5c191450c01097ebbdd17471208","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are in one plane: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们在平面,这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0baea898b1be8c8540e0b4437dbfc1605526fbf10d1d5f6f682f651781c40e51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line BC is not in a more elevated plane; therefore the three straight lines BC, BD, BE are in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC线的长度不是更高,而是平面线;因此,3条BC、BD、BE线是1 平面线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5dd2fc842da6b5efd116204b33779a69e1f8ee45d6d2f078bd4d47783fd0a512","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if a straight line be set up at right angles to three straight lines, at their point of meeting, the three straight lines are in one plane. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果在直角至3条直线交错处设置一条直线,则三条直线为一条平面. 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-5.source","contentId":"euclid-11-5","revisionId":"euclid-11-5@raw-4b3cf298525a71a7","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2610b55687ff9de953eed19d32e470ee4ead09ec52ad4219dbd3067bf3afd21d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"XI. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-5.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"XI. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-5.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-11-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-6.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"XI. 5"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-3","book":11,"number":3,"kind":"proposition","title":"两个相交平面的交线是一条直线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-4:explicit","id":"euclid-11-4","book":11,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"同时垂直两条相交直线则垂直其所在平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-5:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","id":"euclid-11-def-3","book":11,"number":3,"kind":"definition","title":"直线垂直于平面","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-11-5:explicit","id":"euclid-11-6","book":11,"number":6,"kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一平面的两条直线互相平行","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
